# Package data.
#
# The 24 summarized tables in inst/extdata ARE committed (1.31 MB). They are the
# inputs every manuscript table is built from, and the build has to work offline
# from a bare clone. Only the three event-level OFF tables are too large to
# commit (347 MB together; one exceeds GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit) -- those
# are published as Release assets and fetched on demand. See ../README.md.
#
# The negation is required, and it has to be here rather than in the root
# .gitignore: the root file carries its own `*.parquet`, and a deeper .gitignore
# only overrides a shallower one for paths it actually matches.
!inst/extdata/*.parquet
inst/extdata/full48h_llas_offs.parquet
inst/extdata/full48h_clas_offs.parquet
inst/extdata/full48h_blas_offs.parquet
config/summary_tables/summary.csv
config/summary_tables/archive/
*.pyc

# Outputs and other large files
_output*/
_figures/
*.pdf

# IDE directories
.claude/
.cursor/
.vscode/

# Quarto files
/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb

# Pixi environments
.pixi/
!.pixi/config.toml

# renv
renv/library/
renv/staging/
renv/sandbox/

# Other environment files.
# .Rprofile is tracked: it is renv's bootstrap hook (`source("renv/activate.R")`),
# and renv/activate.R is tracked already. Without it a fresh clone has the renv
# machinery but no autoload, so `renv::restore()` does not bootstrap.
.here

##### Stock GitHub R .gitignore entries #####

# History files
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history

# Session Data files
.RData
.RDataTmp

# User-specific files
.Ruserdata

# Example code in package build process
*-Ex.R

# Output files from R CMD build
/*.tar.gz

# Output files from R CMD check
/*.Rcheck/

# RStudio files
.Rproj.user/

# produced vignettes
vignettes/*.html
vignettes/*.pdf

# OAuth2 token, see https://github.com/hadley/httr/releases/tag/v0.3
.httr-oauth

# knitr and R markdown default cache directories
*_cache/
/cache/

# Temporary files created by R markdown
*.utf8.md
*.knit.md

# R Environment Variables
.Renviron

# pkgdown site
docs/

# translation temp files
po/*~

# RStudio Connect folder
rsconnect/
# pixi environments
.pixi/*
!.pixi/config.toml
